%% Publication source (zh-TW) for the Day 23 article figure.
%% English semantic companion: container-shutdown-timeline.md — keep the two in the same topology.
%% The planning repo stores only the rendered PNG snapshot (proposal 005).
%% The init directive is a legibility fix, not a topology change: mermaid's
%% default gantt font is ~11px against the 1400px layout width the pinned
%% renderer uses, which lands at ~5px once the PNG is scaled to article width.
%% It belongs here rather than in render_diagram.sh, whose parameters must stay
%% uniform across every diagram in the series.
%%{init: {"gantt": {"fontSize": 20, "sectionFontSize": 20, "barHeight": 38, "barGap": 8, "leftPadding": 190, "titleTopMargin": 30}}}%%
gantt
    title SIGTERM 之後的 30 秒——三層 deadline 各自屬於誰
    dateFormat X
    axisFormat %Ss
    section runtime 所有
    SIGTERM→SIGKILL grace 30s（ACA 預設、本系列釘住；本地用 docker stop -t 30 對齊） :crit, grace, 0, 30s
    section uvicorn 所有
    request drain ≤20s（--timeout-graceful-shutdown 只框這段） :active, drain, 0, 20s
    section app 所有
    lifespan cleanup ≤8s（四 closer 共用一條 deadline） :cleanup, after drain, 8s
    margin 2s（未量測假設） :margin, after cleanup, 2s
